# Architecture

1. Read `architecture/MASTER_ARCHITECTURE.md` → `architecture/MODULE_REGISTRY.md`.
2. Evaluate **Registry coverage status**; read `architecture/modules/<id>/` when `AUTHORITY_ACTIVE`.
3. Substantive changes: update module `CURRENT_STATE.md`, `FUNCTION_CATALOG.md`, append `CHANGE_LEDGER.md`; note registry **UPDATED** / **UNCHANGED**.
4. Cross-module edits: skim each affected module README.
5. Run `npm run validate` before claiming done (`validate:i18n` only when scope is i18n catalogs/validators).

`SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md` = logical system. Core integration docs only — no live wiring without authorization.

Owners in MODULE_REGISTRY approve boundary changes.
